    src   "target object class. If class is DreamWidget then TargetObject is HelperWidget, if class is DreamUIBehaviour then TargetObject is the component."
    text  "目标对象类。如果类是 DreamWidget（控件），则 TargetObject 是 HelperWidget；如果类是 DreamUIBehaviour，则 TargetObject 是组件。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIEventDelegateData:HelperComponentIndex {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamUIEventDelegate.h#DreamUIEventDelegateData:HelperComponentIndex
    src   "Which behaviour, when HelperClass is a UDreamUIBehaviour: its position in the widget's component\narray. The same key FDreamWidgetPropertyBinding::BehaviourIndex uses, and for the same reason --\nan instanced sub-object and its authored copy share no name, and UE re-numbers the instance's\nFName on every preview rebuild. INDEX_NONE means \"not recorded\"; see HelperComponentName."
    text  "当 HelperClass 是 UDreamUIBehaviour 时，指定哪个行为：它在控件的组件\n数组中的位置。与属性绑定 FDreamWidgetPropertyBinding::BehaviourIndex 使用相同的键，原因也相同——\n实例化子对象与其源副本不共享名称，且 UE 会在每次预览重建时重新编号实例的\nFName。INDEX_NONE 表示“未记录”；参见 HelperComponentName。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIEventDelegateData:HelperComponentName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamUIEventDelegate.h#DreamUIEventDelegateData:HelperComponentName
    src   "LEGACY key, kept so assets saved before HelperComponentIndex existed still resolve. Consulted\nonly when the index is INDEX_NONE, and the index is written back the first time it resolves."
    text  "旧版键，保留它是为了让在 HelperComponentIndex（组件索引）出现之前保存的资产仍能解析。仅当索引为\nINDEX_NONE 时才会查询它，并在首次解析成功时回写索引。"
    state machine
}

