DreamUIEventDelegateData:StructValue {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamUIEventDelegate.h#DreamUIEventDelegateData:StructValue
    src   "A `Struct` parameter's value, as exported text. Not in ParamBuffer: see the enum's Struct entry.\nEmpty means \"the struct's own defaults\", which is what a freshly picked function should send."
    text  "`Struct` 参数的值，以导出文本表示。不在 ParamBuffer 中：参见枚举的 Struct 项。\n为空表示“使用结构体自身的默认值”，这也是刚选取的函数应当发送的值。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIEventDelegateData:StructValueType {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamUIEventDelegate.h#DreamUIEventDelegateData:StructValueType
    src   "Which struct StructValue was written for. The type actually sent is always the one the target\nfunction declares TODAY; this is here so a mismatch is an error rather than a partial parse --\ntwo unrelated structs can both accept a text literal that names a member they happen to share,\nand quietly sending half a value is worse than sending the defaults and saying so."
    text  "StructValue 是为哪个结构体写入的。实际发送的类型始终是目标\n函数当前声明的类型；保留此项是为了让不匹配成为错误，而不是部分解析——\n两个不相关的结构体都可能接受一个文本字面量，只要其中命名了它们碰巧共有的成员，\n而悄悄发送一半的值，比发送默认值并说明情况更糟。"
    state machine
}

