EDreamUIEventDelegateParameterType.Int8 {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamUIEventDelegate.h#EDreamUIEventDelegateParameterType:Int8
    src   "The narrow and unsigned integers are offered like any other type: every one of them has a\nbuffer size (GetParameterBufferSize), a typed field on FDreamUIEventDelegateData, an editor row\nand a change handler, so the only thing Hidden bought was an author who could not declare a\nnative event carrying the argument their own C++ delegate already passes. None stays hidden --\nit is the enum's \"not initialized\", not a type anyone can mean."
    text  "窄整型和无符号整型与其他任何类型一样提供：它们每一个都有\n缓冲区大小（GetParameterBufferSize）、FDreamUIEventDelegateData 上的类型化字段、一个编辑器行\n和一个变更处理程序，因此 Hidden 换来的唯一东西，就是作者无法声明一个\n原生事件来携带其自己的 C++ 委托已经传递的参数。None 不会保持隐藏——\n它是枚举的“未初始化”，不是任何人会表示的类型。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUIEventDelegateParameterType.None {
